schema: "0.4"
id: npl-prism-34-creative-assets-pipeline
type: image
quality: high

# NoizuPromptLingo creative suite — Creative Assets Pipeline: generate, regenerate,
# accept/reject, and publish AI-generated creative assets, with bulk jobs queued and
# rate-limited.
# Theme tenets: luminous frosted glass, cool violet→cyan spectrum gradient, Sora
# geometric type, generous 16px radius; data-dense controls stay legible on glass.
# Palette: violet #7c3aed, cyan #06b6d4, fuchsia #d946ef, canvas #f7f8ff, ink #1a1730.

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior product designer rendering a high-fidelity UI mockup of a
    PREMIUM creative-generation workspace inside a modern AI product. The register is
    polished and energetic but composed — a creative operator's tool, not a toy.
    Frosted-glass cards float over a pale spectrum mesh; the primary generate/publish
    actions carry the signature violet→cyan gradient. Clean geometric sans-serif (Sora)
    throughout, no serif. Comfortable density: a few large glass cards, room to breathe.
  text: |
    A 16:9 high-fidelity UI mockup of the CREATIVE ASSETS PIPELINE screen of
    NoizuPromptLingo's creative suite (route /app/[orgId]/assets).

    OVERALL LAYOUT (three bands): a slim LEFT app nav rail (achromatic glass icons,
    secondary), a dominant CENTER work area, and a RIGHT ~320px BULK QUEUE panel — all
    over a pale near-white canvas (#f7f8ff) with a soft blurred violet/cyan spectrum
    mesh glowing through the glass surfaces.

    HEADER BAND (top of center): screen title "Creative Assets" in Sora 700, an org
    breadcrumb, and a primary "Generate" button with a violet→cyan gradient fill and
    soft glow at the right.

    ASSET GENERATION CARD (center, the hero surface): a large frosted-glass card, 16px
    radius, 1px gradient-sheen edge, violet-tinted soft shadow. Top of the card = a
    PROMPT / PARAMETERS input area: a glass text field (translucent with an opaque inner
    backing behind the text for legibility) holding a real creative prompt, plus a small
    row of parameter chips (aspect, style, count) as pills. Below = a GENERATED OUTPUT
    PREVIEW: a large rendered image thumbnail with a subtle gradient frame. Under the
    preview, an ACCEPT / REJECT CONTROL (a green ✓ Accept and a muted ✕ Reject as paired
    buttons), a glass "Regenerate" secondary button, and a prominent "Publish active
    output" button (violet→cyan gradient) that marks the accepted candidate as published.
    Show a small "Published" state chip (flat emerald #10b981, opaque, never gradient) on
    one candidate.

    A second, smaller asset card peeks below/beside it to imply a scrollable list of
    asset slots, each its own glass card.

    RIGHT — BULK GENERATION QUEUE PANEL: a frosted glass panel titled "Bulk queue" with
    a vertical list of job rows, each showing a small status pill — "running" (flat
    violet), "queued" (muted glass), and one "rate-limited" (flat amber #f59e0b with a
    small clock glyph) — plus a thin progress bar and a job label. A muted line notes
    "throttled to org limit". Semantics are flat opaque chips, never gradient.

    PALETTE & TYPE: cool near-white canvas + soft spectrum mesh; ink #1a1730 text; the
    signature violet(#7c3aed)→cyan(#06b6d4) gradient only on the Generate / Publish
    buttons and glass-card edges; status uses flat opaque semantic chips (emerald/amber).
    Sora everywhere, no serif; mono only if an ID or generation seed is shown.

    SHAPE & SURFACE: 16px card radius, 12px on small controls, pill chips; translucent
    frosted surfaces with backdrop blur, gradient-sheen borders, violet-tinted soft
    shadows; the mesh glows through. Comfortable, premium, luminous.

    MOOD: premium, creative, energetic-but-calm. A tool a growth/creative operator lives
    in — color in gradient and glass, legibility never sacrificed to the material.
  negative: "watermark, signature, lorem ipsum placeholder text, low-fidelity wireframe, monitor/device photograph framing, blurry, distorted UI, gradient body text, gradient status chips, rainbow tie-dye buttons, neon-on-black cyberpunk, scanlines"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    relevance: {weight: 3, description: "Matches the pipeline's key components — Asset Generation Card with prompt input + output preview, Accept/Reject control, Regenerate + Publish buttons, right-side Bulk Generation Queue with queued/running/rate-limited jobs"}
    theme_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Prism frosted glass over a spectrum mesh, violet→cyan gradient on primary actions/edges only, flat opaque semantic status chips, Sora type, 16px radius — not generic gray SaaS defaults"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Clear hierarchy, comfortable creative-suite density, plausible real-product layout"}
    technical: {weight: 2, description: "Sharp, correct 16:9 aspect, legible small text on glass, no artifacts"}
  reject_if:
    - "lorem ipsum or placeholder text visible"
    - "watermark or signature visible"
    - "wireframe-level fidelity instead of high-fidelity mockup"
    - "gradient status chips or gradient body text"
    - "flat monochrome gray console with no color or glass"

tags: [npl-prism, NoizuPromptLingo, screen-mockup, creative-suite]
